Package: tuxdrive
Version: 0.1.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: TuxDrive contributors <tpluharik@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1, rclone (>= 1.58), fuse3, xdg-utils
Recommends: libnotify-bin
Homepage: https://github.com/tpluharik/Tuxdrive
Description: Google Drive and Microsoft OneDrive client for Ubuntu
 TuxDrive provides browser-based OAuth, multiple cloud accounts, two-way and
 one-way synchronization, selective folders, conflict handling, tray controls,
 notifications, and files-on-demand virtual drives through rclone and FUSE.
